{"unit_id":"jidekaixin2dian__dsh-team-flow#feature-1","repo":"jidekaixin2dian/dsh-team-flow","commit":"9a24af71eb2cd630648dc80d954e8c5902bfd5cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-team-flow-continuous 的功能「wait-steer」：用户在同一 Lead 的 wait_agent 等待期间发送 Steer 时，插件结束当前这一轮等待并让原生循环领取原消息；队友不会因此停止。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wake-core.ts:67-100"]}
